  "notes": {
    "manas-2010:p0021:b002:l021": "отогот is possibly defective отого (plume or headdress ornament). Rendered broadly as ornaments; exact reading unresolved.",
    "manas-2010:p0021:b002:l023": "Луң-туң retained as lung-tung, an unresolved rank/designation. No invented English equivalent.",
    "manas-2010:p0021:b002:l033": "Burut is the exonym used by opposing characters for the Kyrgyz; retained inside quoted speech.",
    "manas-2010:p0021:b002:l035": "Он эки кылым салбаптыр is syntactically uncertain. Twelve peoples and offered no resistance is a provisional contextual reading, not an established emendation.",
    "manas-2010:p0022:b002:l007": "ак үйлүү interpreted here as the hostage institution. Exact phrase and sense require comparison with another witness.",
    "manas-2010:p0022:b002:l017": "керик/rhinoceros and бил/elephant are epic animals; preserved rather than rationalized away.",
    "manas-2010:p0023:b002:l019": "кызыталак is an abusive formula; damned is a provisional idiomatic rendering, not a literal etymological gloss.",
    "manas-2010:p0023:b002:l035": "Чалгырты is uncertain in this witness. Treacherous gleam is contextual; verify against manuscript or academic edition.",
    "manas-2010:p0021:b002:l015": "Lexical correction2026-09-14: кундуз animal/fur means otter, primary Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/кундуз/51–54 including exact collar-endearment formula;1969/2015 aquatic carnivorous mammal supports. Earlier beaver reading corrected; raw/SHA/bbox unchanged."
  }
